            ^"Appearance" STRING "Éamonn is a handsome young man who clearly carries the refinement of the Sidhe in his blood. With his sparkling blue eyes, bouncy blond hair, and easy smile, he is every father’s nightmare and every husband’s fear. The Contested Isle: The Hibernian Tribunal, page 117 The Contested Isle: The Hibernian Tribunal, page 116 The Contested Isle: The Hibernian Tribunal, page 116. Functionally identical to Enchanting Music, but using stories instead of music. His mother has depended on Éamonn for money since an illness left her weak some years ago, so without Éamonn she may lose her home."
